cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  gingiCHARM: a curated reference database and software package
  for whole-genome characterisation and multi-scheme typing of
  Porphyromonas gingivalis
message: If you use gingiCHARM in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Susanth
    family-names: Alapati
abstract: >-
  gingiCHARM (P. gingivalis CHaracterisation, Allele typing and
  Reference Module) characterises a Porphyromonas gingivalis genome
  assembly from a single curated reference database: virulence-factor
  screening, fimA, mfa operon, rag and capsular K-antigen typing, and
  a functional category for every predicted gene.
keywords:
  - Porphyromonas gingivalis
  - periodontitis
  - oral anaerobes
  - bacterial typing
  - virulence factors
  - comparative genomics
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/S-Alapati/gingiCHARM
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-06
